OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder after
OL,4,Asteak-knife stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life after
OL,7,Fadmitting killing a man by stabbing him
OL,8,Fin the neck with a steak knife.
OL,10,FIan Jackson-Wynch, 55, was found
OL,11,Fseriously injured at a flat on
OL,12,FGreyfriars in Grantham on 26 January
OL,13,Fand pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,15,FCarl Copus, 55, pleaded guilty to the
OL,16,Fmurder during a court hearing in
OL,17,FLoughborough in July.
OL,19,FHe was sentenced to a minimum term of
OL,20,F16 years and 152 days at Lincoln Crown
OL,21,FCourt earlier.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
